    "innovation": "This paper reveals a global asymmetry where cities with the highest future heat risk (low-latitudes) have the lowest cooling potential from mitigation strategies, underscoring the urgent need for accelerated and context-specific cooling actions.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "WRF",
